          "text": "Lower-limb neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Tone normal; power 5/5 throughout. Knee reflexes reduced bilaterally; ankle jerks absent. Light touch and pin sensation reduced to mid-calf bilaterally; vibration and proprioception reduced at great toes and ankles. Allodynia to light touch on dorsum of feet. Romberg positive and unsteady with eyes closed."
      }
